/reference/k-proof/runtime-kompiled/README.md:15:- `compiled.txt` - user readable definition after all the kompile steps have been applied. Variable
/reference/k-proof/runtime-kompiled/README.md:22:  - `backend.txt` - the backend used to kompile: haskell|llvm
/reference/k-proof/runtime-kompiled/README.md:29:  subsequent kompile calls only the newly modified rules will be parsed. This is the main file
/reference/k-proof/runtime-kompiled/README.md:31:- `compiled.bin` - the entire definition as a binary dump from Java. Used by `kprove`.
