+      "exit_code": 0,
+      "output_sha256": "c1954e83b6c0ad19ed27664b886ad59b87ce251dd99f44e36b89698cd4e71b96",
+      "output_tail": "✔ [2/9] Built Klean33SortThird.Prelude\n✔ [3/9] Built Klean33SortThird.Sorts\n✔ [4/9] Built Klean33SortThird.Inj\n⚠ [5/9] Built Klean33SortThird.Lemmas\nwarning: Klean33SortThird/Lemmas.lean:15:26: unused variable `h`\n\nNote: This linter can be disabled with `set_option linter.unusedVariables false`\n✔ [6/9] Built Klean33SortThird.Func\n✔ [7/9] Built Klean33SortThird.Rewrite\n✔ [8/9] Built Klean33SortThird\nBuild completed successfully.\n"
