+FROZEN K DOMAIN AND OPERATION
+/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/core.k:
+  line 14: syntax ValSeq ::= ".ValSeq" | vCons(Val, ValSeq)
+  line 15: syntax Str ::= str(IntSeq)
+  lines 18-23: syntax Iterable ::= list(ValSeq) | tuple(ValSeq) | Str | rangeObj(...) | zipObj(...) | zipObjS(...)
+  lines 25-29: syntax Val ::= Int | Bool | "noneV" | Iterable | ref(Int) | ...
+
+/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/sort.k:
+  lines 18-24 define concrete sortVS/insVS equations for integer ValSeqs.
+  lines 25-32 define concrete sortVS/insVSs equations for str(IntSeq) ValSeqs using lexicographic strLt.
+
+/reference/k-proof/solution.py line 2 applies Python sorted to l[::3] without an integer-only precondition. /reference/k-proof/concrete_test.py lines 22-24 checks the normal-return string input ["z","keep","also","a"] and expected output ["a","keep","also","z"].
+
+GENERATED LEAN DOMAIN
+FILE CREATED ONLY IN THE FRESH AUDIT COPY
+PrintValueDomain.lean:
+  import Klean33SortThird.Sorts
+  #print SortIterable
+  #print SortVal
+
+COMMAND
+LD_PRELOAD=/tmp/audit-work/lean_proc_self_fix.so lake env lean PrintValueDomain.lean
+
+EXACT RESULT (exit 0)
+inductive SortIterable : Type
+number of parameters: 0
+constructors:
+SortIterable.«list(_)_MPY-CORE_Iterable_ValSeq» : SortValSeq → SortIterable
+SortIterable.«rangeObj(_,_,_)_MPY-CORE_Iterable_Int_Int_Int» : SortInt → SortInt → SortInt → SortIterable
+SortIterable.«tuple(_)_MPY-CORE_Iterable_ValSeq» : SortValSeq → SortIterable
+SortIterable.«zipObj(_,_)_MPY-CORE_Iterable_ValSeq_ValSeq» : SortValSeq → SortValSeq → SortIterable
+SortIterable.«zipObjS(_,_)_MPY-CORE_Iterable_IntSeq_IntSeq» : SortIntSeq → SortIntSeq → SortIterable
+inductive SortVal : Type
+number of parameters: 0
+constructors:
+SortVal.inj_SortBool : SortBool → SortVal
+SortVal.inj_SortFloat : SortFloat → SortVal
+SortVal.inj_SortInt : SortInt → SortVal
+SortVal.inj_SortIterable : SortIterable → SortVal
+SortVal.«boundMethodV(_,_)_MPY-CORE_Val_Val_String» : SortVal → SortString → SortVal
+SortVal.«builtinV(_)_MPY-CORE_Val_String» : SortString → SortVal
+SortVal.«cellRef(_)_MPY-CORE_Val_Int» : SortInt → SortVal
+SortVal.«cellsMark(_)_MPY-CORE_Val_ParamNames» : SortParamNames → SortVal
+SortVal.«closureVal(_,_,_)_MPY-CORE_Val_ParamNames_Stmts_Int» : SortParamNames → SortStmts → SortInt → SortVal
+SortVal.«closureValC(_,_,_,_)_MPY-FUNCTIONS_Val_ParamNames_ParamNames_Stmts_Map» : SortParamNames → SortParamNames → SortStmts → SortMap → SortVal
+SortVal.«dictV(_,_)_MPY-DICT_Val_ValSeq_ValSeq» : SortValSeq → SortValSeq → SortVal
